<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan stock market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Taiwan stock market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's stock market is closed on Thursday due to a national holiday. It will reopen on Friday.</p>
<p>On Wednesday, the index ended up 66.42 points or 1.04 percent at 6,426.09. Turnover was a modest T$39.95 billion. -- Kevin Chen (5080815)</p>
</text>
